# Internal files that must never be served from ivypathacademy.com.
# The site deploys with outputDirectory "." (static, no build), so every
# uploaded file becomes a public URL. Until 2026-09-28 these returned 200:
# /PRODUCT.md, /DESIGN.md, /docs/..., /server/server.js, /.githooks/*.
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they only match at the repo root
# (an unanchored docs/ would also match node_modules/googleapis/.../apis/docs,
# which googleapis loads at require time).
/docs/
/tests/
/server/
/.githooks/
/PRODUCT.md
/DESIGN.md
/playwright.config.js
# Old Meta ad creatives (June). Not used by any page; N4 shows a family's home
# distance and N1/N4 carry guarantee claims, so they must not be public.
/assets/ads/
